      "role": "user",
      "content": "rebellion is just another word for more struggle tho. if the endgame is always just being forgotten and everything turning to dust, why is it better to struggle through the pain instead of just letting go? like, if nothing matters, shouldn't the most logical thing to do be to just stop the noise?",
